WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:04.367
-Hey, everybody, we are back
with Cameron Diaz

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:08.567
here to celebrate Cameron's wine
brand Avaline.

00:00:08.567 --> 00:00:10.834
She and I are going to face off
in the world's first ever

00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:13.067
wine scooter race.

00:00:13.067 --> 00:00:15.067
-We've done this before.
-Are you ready for this?

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:16.167
-I'm ready for this.
-Alright.

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:17.634
Now here's the way
it's going to work,

00:00:17.634 --> 00:00:21.300
We're gonna be riding these
one-of-a-kind grape scooters

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:22.634
whiel wearing these wine
helmets, okay.

00:00:22.634 --> 00:00:25.000
Cameron and I will --
-Are these grapes?

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.634
I'm so glad because right now
I've seen childbirth

00:00:27.634 --> 00:00:29.601
and this looks like a different
situation.

00:00:29.601 --> 00:00:31.567
-What is --
-Women do you know

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:32.901
what I'm talking about?
-Beautiful grapes.

00:00:32.901 --> 00:00:34.334
These are beautiful grapes.
-They are grapes.

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:35.634
-They are grapes.

00:00:35.634 --> 00:00:39.367
Cameron and I will race out of
these doors past our

00:00:39.367 --> 00:00:42.434
roller skating cocktail waiter
and then we're going to

00:00:42.434 --> 00:00:46.100
head to the elevator bend and go
around the wine mime.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:48.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.000
-Why does he get an applause?
Oh, you dropped it.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.367
-He's juggling breadsticks.
-Then we're going to go back

00:00:51.367 --> 00:00:54.601
down the hallway and pass a
bachelorette party

00:00:54.601 --> 00:00:59.133
who's been rose-ing all day.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:02.968
After that, we'll be careful to
avoid our 7-foot-tall

00:01:02.968 --> 00:01:04.367
wine bottle --
-Holy!

00:01:04.367 --> 00:01:08.467
-take a right through
the low hanging grapes.

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:11.300
and for the last leg of the race
we'll head through cork alley.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:14.667
Where it looks like Hasthtag the
panda and the t-shirt Yeti are

00:01:14.667 --> 00:01:16.167
having a cork fight.

00:01:16.167 --> 00:01:20.100
Now, the first person to cross
through the boxes of wine wins.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.567
And that's where we'll celebrate
with some

00:01:21.567 --> 00:01:23.934
delicious Avaline wine.
Cameron, are you ready for this?

00:01:23.934 --> 00:01:27.000
-I'm so ready.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.067
Don't forget your brake.
-Yeah, don't forget the brakes.

00:01:30.067 --> 00:01:32.200
-Jimmy hates to lose.
-Jimmy doesn't use brakes.

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:35.634
-He doesn't like it.
-Jimmy doesn't use brakes.

00:01:35.634 --> 00:01:36.834
[ Laughter ]
-Ready?

00:01:36.834 --> 00:01:38.467
-Yeah.

00:01:38.467 --> 00:01:40.567
I thought you were in a speedo
and a bikini.

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:43.300
-What's that? No, that was just
my off-camera --

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:45.501
-Oh, yeah, sorry.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.501 --> 00:01:52.868
-Three, two, one, go!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:52.868 --> 00:01:53.868
-You cut me off!

00:01:53.868 --> 00:01:57.534
♪♪

00:01:57.534 --> 00:02:04.434
-Oh, my -- sorry, sorry!

00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:05.634
-The other way!

00:02:05.634 --> 00:02:08.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.067 --> 00:02:10.033
-Sorry! Did I make you drop your
wine, mime?

00:02:10.033 --> 00:02:12.834
♪♪

00:02:12.834 --> 00:02:17.234
-Wait, are we supposed to --

00:02:17.234 --> 00:02:21.133
-Oh, my God!

00:02:21.133 --> 00:02:23.534
Whoo!

00:02:23.534 --> 00:02:24.868
-Wait, are we supposed to --

00:02:24.868 --> 00:02:31.267
-[ Screaming ]

00:02:31.267 --> 00:02:32.834
-Oh my God.
-Whoo!

00:02:32.834 --> 00:02:33.968
-[ Screaming ]
-[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.968 --> 00:02:36.067
-I lost my hat!
-[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.067 --> 00:02:38.067
-Be careful!

00:02:38.067 --> 00:02:40.100
Don't hit her.
-Ready?

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:41.267
-Yes.
-Ready?

00:02:41.267 --> 00:02:43.834
-Yes.
Go for it, bud.

00:02:43.834 --> 00:02:52.501
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Whoo!

00:02:52.501 --> 00:02:54.901
-We got to the finish
line together!

00:02:54.901 --> 00:02:56.968
My thanks to Cameron Diaz.

00:02:56.968 --> 00:02:58.968
Avaline is available now.

00:02:58.968 --> 00:03:01.267
Thanks, higgins.
At drinkavaline.com.

